      "id": 3,
      "start": 5.24,
      "end": 5.94,
      "en": "And I'm Erica.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erica。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 6.48,
      "end": 11.46,
      "en": "And today we're going to be going to one of the least favorite places of many, many people.",
      "zh": "今天我们将去许多人中最不喜欢的地方之一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 11.88,
      "end": 13.88,
      "en": "So it must be the dentist.",
      "zh": "所以一定是牙医。"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 14.34,
      "end": 14.6,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 15.18,
      "end": 18.62,
      "en": "That place where you have to go every six months, but...",
      "zh": "每六个月必须去的地方，但是..."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 18.62,
      "end": 20.72,
      "en": "You probably don't go.",
      "zh": "你可能不去。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 21.14,
      "end": 22.14,
      "en": "You probably don't.",
      "zh": "你可能没有。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 22.22,
      "end": 23.58,
      "en": "I know I don't go every six months.",
      "zh": "我知道我不会每六个月去一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 24.6,
      "end": 34.07,
      "en": "So yeah, we're going to be going to the dentist and of course we're going to be looking at a lot of great vocabulary related to teeth and all that crazy stuff dentists do.",
      "zh": "所以，是的，我们将去看牙医，当然我们会看到很多与牙齿相关的好词汇以及牙医所做的所有疯狂的事情。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 34.35,
      "end": 34.59,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 34.59,
      "end": 36.89,
      "en": "And we'll also learn some really interesting phrases.",
      "zh": "我们还将学习一些非常有趣的短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 37.69,
      "end": 40.85,
      "en": "So Marco, let's get started with our vocabulary preview.",
      "zh": "所以马可，让我们开始我们的词汇预览。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 43.04,
      "end": 44.04,
      "en": "Vocabulary preview.",
      "zh": "词汇预览。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 44.04,
      "end": 47.48,
      "en": "Okay, in vocabulary preview today we have two words.",
      "zh": "好的，在今天的词汇预览中有两个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 47.48,
      "end": 48.53,
      "en": "Let's take a look at the first one.",
      "zh": "我们来看看第一个。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 49.48,
      "end": 49.75,
      "en": "Toothache.",
      "zh": "牙疼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 50.35,
      "end": 50.83,
      "en": "Toothache.",
      "zh": "牙疼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 51.63,
      "end": 52.23,
      "en": "Toothache.",
      "zh": "牙疼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 52.65,
      "end": 53.25,
      "en": "Toothache.",
      "zh": "牙疼。"
    },
    {
