      "end": 60.68,
      "en": "It means it hurts.",
      "zh": "这意味着它很痛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 60.68,
      "end": 61.68,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 61.68,
      "end": 62.68,
      "en": "So again, a toothache would be?",
      "zh": "再说一次，牙痛会是什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 62.68,
      "end": 63.68,
      "en": "A hurting tooth.",
      "zh": "一颗疼痛的牙齿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 63.68,
      "end": 64.68,
      "en": "A hurting tooth.",
      "zh": "一颗疼痛的牙齿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 64.68,
      "end": 65.68,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 65.68,
      "end": 67.52,
      "en": "We can also say stomachache, headache.",
      "zh": "我们也可以说胃痛，头痛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 67.52,
      "end": 68.52,
      "en": "Yep.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 68.52,
      "end": 69.13,
      "en": "Pretty much everything can...",
      "zh": "几乎所有的东西都可以..."
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 69.52,
      "end": 70.07,
      "en": "Ache.",
      "zh": "疼痛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 70.52,
      "end": 71.52,
      "en": "Ache.",
      "zh": "疼痛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 71.52,
      "end": 72.52,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 72.52,
      "end": 73.52,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 73.52,
      "end": 74.52,
      "en": "So our next word, x-ray.",
      "zh": "所以我们的下一个词，X 光。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 74.52,
      "end": 75.52,
      "en": "X-ray.",
      "zh": "X射线。"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 75.52,
      "end": 76.52,
      "en": "X-ray.",
      "zh": "X射线。"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 76.52,
      "end": 78.96,
      "en": "X hyphen R-A-Y.",
      "zh": "x 连字符 R-A-Y。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 79.41,
      "end": 80.55,
      "en": "Okay, pretty easy word.",
      "zh": "好吧，很简单的词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 81.28,
      "end": 85.64,
      "en": "So when you go to the doctor, many times you'll get an x-ray.",
      "zh": "所以当你去看医生时，你会得到 X 光片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 85.64,
      "end": 87.86,
      "en": "It is a picture of your bones.",
      "zh": "这是你骨头的照片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 88.56,
      "end": 89.56,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 89.56,
      "end": 90.8,
      "en": "So that's an x-ray.",
      "zh": "所以这是X光片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "start": 90.8,
      "end": 91.8,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "start": 92.06,
      "end": 94.84,
      "en": "Well, we're going to hear both of these words in the dialogue.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们将在对话中听到这两个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "start": 95.24,
      "end": 98.36,
      "en": "So why don't we listen as Gary visits his dentist?",
      "zh": "那么，当 Gary 拜访他的牙医时，我们为什么不听呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "start": 109.68,
      "end": 114.12,
      "en": "Hey, Gary, great to see you again.",
      "zh": "嘿，加里，很高兴再次见到你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 114.96,
      "end": 116.42,
      "en": "Please have a seat.",
      "zh": "请坐。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 117.72,
      "end": 122.16,
      "en": "So tell me what seems to be the problem.",
      "zh": "说说看，哪里不舒服？"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 123.06,
      "end": 123.86,
      "en": "Thanks, doc.",
      "zh": "谢谢，医生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 53,
      "start": 124.42,
      "end": 125.64,
      "en": "I've got a really bad toothache.",
      "zh": "我牙疼得厉害。"
    },
    {
      "id": 54,
      "start": 126.18,
      "end": 127.14,
      "en": "I can't eat anything.",
      "zh": "我什么都不能吃。"
    },
    {
      "id": 55,
      "start": 127.32,
      "end": 128.8,
      "en": "And look, my face is all swollen.",
      "zh": "看，我的脸肿了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 56,
      "start": 129.88,
      "end": 131.44,
      "en": "I think it might be my wisdom teeth.",
      "zh": "我觉得可能是智齿的问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 57,
      "start": 132.68,
      "end": 135.47,
      "en": "Well, let's have a look.",
      "zh": "好吧，让我们看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 58,
      "start": 136.88,
      "end": 137.45,
      "en": "Open wide.",
      "zh": "嘴张大。"
    },
    {
      "id": 59,
      "start": 141.88,
      "end": 149.88,
      "en": "This doesn't look good.",
      "zh": "看起来情况不妙。"
    },
    {
      "id": 60,
      "start": 150.0,
      "end": 155.0,
      "en": "Well, it looks like you have a cavity and your crown is loose.",
      "zh": "你有颗牙蛀了，牙冠也松了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 61,
      "start": 156.36,
      "end": 160.36,
      "en": "You'll need to put in a filling before it gets any worse.",
      "zh": "得赶紧补牙，免得更严重。"
    },
    {
      "id": 62,
      "start": 160.36,
      "end": 164.52,
      "en": "And the crown probably needs to be refitted.",
      "zh": "牙冠可能也得重新装一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 63,
      "start": 164.52,
      "end": 169.0,
      "en": "I'm going to order some x-rays.",
      "zh": "我给你拍几张X光片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 64,
      "start": 169.0,
      "end": 169.5,
      "en": "Is it going to hurt?",
      "zh": "会痛吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 65,
      "start": 170.2,
      "end": 172.14,
      "en": "No, not at all.",
      "zh": "不，完全没有。"
    },
    {
      "id": 66,
      "start": 173.34,
      "end": 175.62,
      "en": "Just lay back and relax.",
      "zh": "往后靠，放轻松。"
    },
    {
      "id": 67,
      "start": 180.92,
      "end": 187.92,
      "en": "Okay, spit.",
      "zh": "好，吐出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "start": 198.08,
      "end": 199.36,
      "en": "Okay, that always happens.",
      "zh": "好吧，这总是发生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 199.54,
      "end": 201.2,
      "en": "The dentist says, no, it's not going to hurt.",
      "zh": "牙医说，不，它不会伤害。"
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "start": 201.44,
      "end": 202.24,
      "en": "Don't worry about it.",
      "zh": "别担心。"
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 202.36,
      "end": 204.8,
      "en": "But it always hurts much more than he says.",
      "zh": "但它总是比他说的更痛。"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "start": 205.38,
      "end": 205.72,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "start": 206.38,
      "end": 212.54,
      "en": "So in this dialogue, we saw some interesting words when the dentist was describing what problems Gary had.",
      "zh": "所以在这次对话中，当牙医描述加里有什么问题时，我们看到了一些有趣的词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "start": 212.8,
      "end": 213.0,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "start": 213.52,
      "end": 216.02,
      "en": "So why don't we look at those now in Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "那么我们为什么不看看现在的语言要点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "start": 217.99,
      "end": 219.15,
      "en": "Language Takeaway.",
      "zh": "语言要点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "start": 219.56,
      "end": 223.08,
      "en": "All right, let's take a look at our first word.",
      "zh": "好吧，让我们来看看我们的第一个字。"
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "start": 223.08,
      "end": 227.33,
      "en": "So Gary said that his face was all swollen.",
      "zh": "所以加里说他的脸肿了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "start": 228.05,
      "end": 228.44,
      "en": "Swollen.",
      "zh": "肿了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "start": 228.44,
      "end": 228.73,
      "en": "Swollen.",
      "zh": "肿了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "start": 229.44,
      "end": 230.44,
      "en": "Swollen.",
      "zh": "肿了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "start": 231.39,
      "end": 234.03,
      "en": "So swollen is an adjective, right Marco?",
      "zh": "所以 swollen 是个形容词，对吧，Marco？"
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "start": 234.33,
      "end": 234.59,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "start": 235.76,
      "end": 239.56,
      "en": "So his face is or was swollen.",
      "zh": "所以他的脸是肿的，或者说当时是肿的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "start": 239.56,
      "end": 240.17,
      "en": "It was bigger.",
      "zh": "它更大。"
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "start": 240.57,
      "end": 242.43,
      "en": "Yeah, his face was bigger than normal.",
      "zh": "是的，他的脸比平时还要大。"
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "start": 242.69,
      "end": 242.85,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "start": 243.37,
      "end": 247.47,
      "en": "Often when you hurt yourself, that part of your body becomes swollen.",
      "zh": "通常你弄伤自己时，身体的那个部位就会肿起来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "start": 247.59,
      "end": 248.43,
      "en": "Swollen, right.",
      "zh": "肿了，对了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "start": 248.65,
      "end": 252.51,
      "en": "So you have to put some ice on it usually and then the swelling will go down.",
      "zh": "所以你通常得在上面敷点冰，然后肿胀就会消退。"
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "start": 252.73,
      "end": 254.33,
      "en": "And that's the noun, the swelling.",
      "zh": "那这就是名词，肿胀。"
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "start": 254.87,
      "end": 255.95,
      "en": "Right, the swelling.",
      "zh": "没错，肿胀。"
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "start": 256.44,
      "end": 257.99,
      "en": "And well, the verb to swell.",
      "zh": "还有动词 to swell，肿起来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "start": 258.48,
      "end": 261.4,
      "en": "All right, three words for the price of one.",
      "zh": "好吧，一个价钱学到三个词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "start": 261.4,
      "end": 268.88,
      "en": "So let's listen to some examples of how we would use the swelling, swollen and to swell.",
      "zh": "所以我们来听几个例子，看看 swelling、swollen 和 to swell 该怎么用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "start": 268.88,
      "end": 269.23,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "start": 271.4,
      "end": 272.24,
      "en": "My nose is swollen.",
      "zh": "我的鼻子肿了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "start": 272.84,
      "end": 273.88,
      "en": "It's the size of a football.",
      "zh": "这是足球的大小。"
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "start": 277.0,
      "end": 277.25,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "start": 279.34,
      "end": 281.48,
      "en": "Put some ice on your foot and the swelling will go down.",
      "zh": "在你脚上敷点冰块，肿胀就会消退。"
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "start": 284.29,
      "end": 285.25,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "start": 287.06,
      "end": 289.94,
      "en": "I got bitten by a spider and my hand is swelling up.",
      "zh": "我被蜘蛛咬了，我的手肿了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "start": 292.6,
      "end": 298.72,
      "en": "All right, so Gary's face was swollen and he thought that it was his wisdom teeth.",
      "zh": "好吧，所以加里的脸肿了，他以为是他的智齿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "start": 298.72,
      "end": 299.22,
      "en": "Wisdom teeth.",
      "zh": "智齿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "start": 299.88,
      "end": 300.88,
      "en": "Wisdom teeth.",
      "zh": "智齿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "start": 300.88,
      "end": 302.44,
      "en": "Okay, so this is interesting.",
      "zh": "好吧，这很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "start": 302.44,
      "end": 303.22,
      "en": "Wisdom is like wise.",
      "zh": "智慧是明智的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "start": 303.58,
      "end": 304.08,
      "en": "Yeah, knowledge.",
      "zh": "是的，知识。"
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "start": 304.44,
      "end": 305.44,
      "en": "Knowledge.",
      "zh": "知识。"
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "start": 305.44,
      "end": 306.44,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 111,
      "start": 306.44,
      "end": 309.6,
      "en": "So these teeth, they're not knowledgeable, but they're called wisdom teeth.",
      "zh": "所以这些牙齿，它们并不博学，却被称为智齿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 112,
      "start": 310.08,
      "end": 312.38,
      "en": "They're the teeth that grow last in your mouth, right?",
      "zh": "它们是最后长在你嘴里的牙齿，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 113,
      "start": 312.48,
      "end": 316.56,
      "en": "Right, they are the last teeth at the very end of your mouth.",
      "zh": "是的，它们是你嘴巴末端的最后一颗牙齿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 114,
      "start": 316.56,
      "end": 318.96,
      "en": "Yes, and usually you get them when you're about 20.",
      "zh": "是的，通常你在 20 岁左右时会得到它们。"
