    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 583.84,
      "end": 584.06,
      "en": "Or anyone.",
      "zh": "或任何人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 584.84,
      "end": 585.84,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 585.84,
      "end": 586.84,
      "en": "Let's have a look.",
      "zh": "我们来看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 586.84,
      "end": 588.6,
      "en": "Let's look at it and see what the problem is.",
      "zh": "让我们看看它，看看有什么问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 589.2,
      "end": 590.44,
      "en": "OK.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 590.44,
      "end": 591.02,
      "en": "Let's have a look.",
      "zh": "我们来看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 591.44,
      "end": 592.44,
      "en": "OK.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 592.44,
      "end": 595.34,
      "en": "And our final phrase, it doesn't look good.",
      "zh": "最后一个短语，it doesn't look good。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 596.34,
      "end": 597.6,
      "en": "It doesn't look good.",
      "zh": "情况不妙。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 597.98,
      "end": 599.14,
      "en": "It doesn't look good.",
      "zh": "情况不妙。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 599.76,
      "end": 601.62,
      "en": "So I can use this phrase for an object, right?",
      "zh": "所以我可以用这个短语来形容一个东西，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 601.96,
      "end": 602.96,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 602.96,
      "end": 604.84,
      "en": "Like, this house doesn't look good.",
      "zh": "就像，这房子看起来不太好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 604.84,
      "end": 605.84,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 605.84,
      "end": 607.54,
      "en": "But here it's used a little bit differently.",
      "zh": "但在这里它的使用方式略有不同。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 607.54,
      "end": 610.68,
      "en": "So why don't we listen to some examples to help us understand the meaning?",
      "zh": "那么我们为什么不听一些例子来帮助我们理解意义呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 612.62,
      "end": 613.5,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 616.06,
      "end": 617.86,
      "en": "John told me it doesn't look good for me.",
      "zh": "约翰告诉我，我的情况不妙。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 618.16,
      "end": 619.22,
      "en": "I probably won't get the job.",
      "zh": "我可能不会得到这份工作。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 622.78,
      "end": 623.6,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 625.65,
      "end": 627.49,
      "en": "It doesn't look good for Michael Jackson.",
      "zh": "迈克尔·杰克逊的情况不妙。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 628.01,
      "end": 628.87,
      "en": "He's in a lot of debt.",
      "zh": "他负债累累。"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 632.44,
      "end": 632.79,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 635.68,
      "end": 638.96,
      "en": "No, the economy doesn't look very good.",
      "zh": "不，经济看起来不是很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 638.96,
      "end": 640.64,
      "en": "OK.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 640.64,
      "end": 643.48,
      "en": "So in the examples, we can see that they are using it for the situation.",
      "zh": "因此，在示例中，我们可以看到他们将其用于这种情况。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 644.04,
      "end": 644.22,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 644.7,
      "end": 646.28,
      "en": "It looks maybe problematic.",
      "zh": "它看起来可能有问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 647.0,
      "end": 647.14,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 647.34,
      "end": 653.28,
      "en": "So when you say it doesn't look good, you basically mean there are going to be problems.",
      "zh": "所以当你说它看起来不太好时，你基本上意味着会有问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 653.72,
      "end": 654.72,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 654.78,
      "end": 655.8,
      "en": "It doesn't look good.",
      "zh": "情况不妙。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 656.44,
      "end": 657.44,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 657.44,
      "end": 658.44,
      "en": "OK.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 658.44,
      "end": 659.81,
      "en": "So great phrases, great words.",
      "zh": "这么棒的短语，很棒的单词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 660.64,
      "end": 664.07,
      "en": "Let's listen to our Gary at the dentist one more time.",
      "zh": "让我们再听一次 Gary 看牙医的对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 664.4,
      "end": 666.19,
      "en": "And then we'll come back and talk a little bit more.",
      "zh": "然后我们会回来多谈谈。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 674.0,
      "end": 675.24,
      "en": "Hey, Gary.",
      "zh": "嘿，加里。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 676.06,
      "end": 677.88,
      "en": "Great to see you again.",
      "zh": "很高兴再次见到你。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 678.76,
      "end": 680.38,
      "en": "Please have a seat.",
      "zh": "请坐。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 681.18,
      "end": 685.34,
      "en": "So tell me what seems to be the problem.",
      "zh": "说说看，哪里不舒服？"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 686.0,
      "end": 687.0,
      "en": "Thanks, Doc.",
      "zh": "谢谢，医生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 688.3,
      "end": 689.46,
      "en": "I've got a really bad toothache.",
      "zh": "我牙疼得厉害。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 689.98,
      "end": 691.02,
      "en": "I can't eat anything.",
      "zh": "我什么都不能吃。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 691.22,
      "end": 692.7,
      "en": "And look, my face is all swollen.",
      "zh": "看，我的脸肿了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 693.54,
      "end": 695.32,
      "en": "I think it might be my wisdom teeth.",
      "zh": "我觉得可能是智齿的问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 696.24,
      "end": 699.2,
      "en": "Well, let's have a look.",
      "zh": "好吧，让我们看看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 699.9,
      "end": 701.24,
      "en": "Open wide.",
      "zh": "嘴张大。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 705.6,
      "end": 713.6,
      "en": "This doesn't look good.",
      "zh": "看起来情况不妙。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 713.74,
      "end": 718.78,
      "en": "Well, it looks like you have a cavity and your crown is loose.",
      "zh": "你有颗牙蛀了，牙冠也松了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 719.88,
      "end": 723.08,
      "en": "We'll need to put in a filling before it gets any worse.",
      "zh": "我们得赶在它恶化之前把牙补上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 724.12,
      "end": 728.28,
      "en": "And the crown probably needs to be refitted.",
      "zh": "牙冠可能也得重新装一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 728.28,
      "end": 732.76,
      "en": "I'm going to order some x-rays.",
      "zh": "我给你拍几张X光片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 732.76,
      "end": 733.26,
      "en": "Is it going to hurt?",
      "zh": "会痛吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 733.76,
      "end": 735.93,
      "en": "No, not at all.",
      "zh": "不，完全没有。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 737.68,
      "end": 739.45,
      "en": "Just lay back and relax.",
      "zh": "往后靠，放轻松。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 746.68,
      "end": 753.68,
      "en": "Okay, spit.",
      "zh": "好，吐出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 763.46,
      "end": 771.16,
      "en": "Well, Marco, speaking of dentists, have you ever had an experience like this where you spat out a tooth at the dentist?",
      "zh": "好吧，Marco，说到牙医，你有没有过这样的经历，在看牙时把一颗牙吐了出来？"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 772.6,
      "end": 778.36,
      "en": "Well, nothing so serious as this, but actually, recently when I was in Cambodia...",
      "zh": "好吧，没有什么比这更严重的了，但实际上，最近我在柬埔寨的时候……"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 778.36,
      "end": 781.04,
      "en": "Oh, right, you called us in Cambodia.",
      "zh": "哦，对了，你在柬埔寨给我们打了电话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 781.04,
      "end": 782.04,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 782.04,
      "end": 784.82,
      "en": "Well, our taxi driver offered us to have some local food.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们的出租车司机让我们吃一些当地的食物。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 786.24,
      "end": 789.32,
      "en": "And he said, well, we're going to have a dog.",
      "zh": "他说，嗯，我们要吃狗肉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 789.32,
      "end": 790.22,
      "en": "So that was interesting.",
      "zh": "所以这很有趣。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 791.42,
      "end": 792.9,
      "en": "Actually, it wasn't that bad.",
      "zh": "实际上，并没有那么糟糕。"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 793.02,
      "end": 793.6,
      "en": "It was pretty good.",
      "zh": "非常好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 794.08,
      "end": 796.68,
      "en": "But, you know, if you get around the fact that it's a dog...",
      "zh": "但是，你知道，如果你能接受它是狗这个事实……"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 796.68,
      "end": 797.8,
      "en": "So what does this have to do with your teeth?",
      "zh": "那么这和你的牙齿有什么关系呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 798.22,
      "end": 801.16,
      "en": "I was eating it and I bit a bone that was hidden.",
      "zh": "我正在吃它，我咬了一块被隐藏的骨头。"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 802.06,
      "end": 803.26,
      "en": "And I chipped my tooth.",
      "zh": "我把牙硌掉了一小块。"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 803.64,
      "end": 804.92,
      "en": "So you broke part of your tooth.",
      "zh": "所以你把你的部分牙齿折断了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 805.08,
      "end": 808.52,
      "en": "Yeah, like half of it, which I had already chipped before.",
      "zh": "对，大概掉了一半，那块之前就硌掉过。"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 809.44,
      "end": 811.08,
      "en": "So I had to go to the dentist.",
      "zh": "所以我不得不去看牙医。"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 811.08,
      "end": 815.8,
      "en": "And so the dentist created a new crown, not with gold or porcelain, actually with a paste.",
      "zh": "于是牙医做了一颗新牙冠，不是用金子或瓷，而是用一种膏状材料。"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "start": 817.28,
      "end": 819.28,
      "en": "And then it becomes hard and it just looks normal.",
      "zh": "然后它变硬了，看起来很正常。"
    },
    {
      "id": 305,
      "start": 819.28,
      "end": 823.32,
      "en": "It doesn't even look like I have a fake crown, so to say.",
      "zh": "可以这么说，它甚至看不出来我装了假牙冠。"
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 823.32,
      "end": 825.62,
      "en": "But dentists can be really expensive.",
      "zh": "但牙医可能真的很贵。"
    },
    {
      "id": 307,
      "start": 825.62,
      "end": 826.78,
      "en": "So how much did this cost?",
      "zh": "那么这花了多少钱呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 308,
      "start": 828.0,
      "end": 831.74,
      "en": "Well, this was for the bargain price of $10.",
      "zh": "这个啊，特价只要 10 美元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 309,
      "start": 832.32,
      "end": 833.32,
      "en": "$10.",
      "zh": "10美元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 310,
      "start": 833.32,
      "end": 834.32,
      "en": "$10.",
      "zh": "10美元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 311,
      "start": 834.32,
      "end": 835.84,
      "en": "That's how much it cost.",
      "zh": "这就是它的成本。"
    },
    {
      "id": 312,
      "start": 835.84,
      "end": 837.9,
      "en": "So we should all go to Cambodia for dentistry.",
      "zh": "所以我们都该去柬埔寨看牙。"
    },
    {
      "id": 313,
      "start": 838.26,
      "end": 839.7,
      "en": "Yeah, because actually it was pretty good.",
      "zh": "是的，因为实际上它非常好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 314,
      "start": 840.08,
      "end": 841.08,
      "en": "He looked really young, though.",
      "zh": "不过，他看起来真的很年轻。"
    },
    {
      "id": 315,
      "start": 841.2,
      "end": 844.14,
      "en": "I was kind of scared because when he walked in, he looked like he was 19.",
      "zh": "我有点害怕，因为当他走进来时，他看起来像 19 岁。"
    },
    {
      "id": 316,
      "start": 845.24,
      "end": 847.32,
      "en": "But I asked him his age and he was like 30.",
      "zh": "但我问他他的年龄，他 30 岁。"
    },
    {
      "id": 317,
      "start": 847.54,
      "end": 848.74,
      "en": "OK, well, you're very trusting.",
      "zh": "好吧，你很容易相信别人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 318,
      "start": 849.5,
      "end": 849.86,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 319,
      "start": 849.96,
      "end": 853.4,
      "en": "So I imagine that you guys maybe have some dental experiences.",
      "zh": "所以我想你们可能有一些牙科体验。"
    },
    {
      "id": 320,
      "start": 853.46,
      "end": 856.08,
      "en": "So why don't you come to our website and tell us all about it?",
      "zh": "那么你为什么不来我们的网站告诉我们所有的事情呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 321,
      "start": 856.26,
      "end": 863.78,
      "en": "Yeah, visit us at EnglishPod.com and you can find lots more resources for learning English there.",
      "zh": "是的，请访问 englishpod.com，您可以找到更多资源来学习英语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 322,
      "start": 864.56,
      "end": 867.1,
      "en": "Well, guys, thanks for listening and until next time.",
      "zh": "好吧，伙计们，感谢您的收听，直到下一次。"
    },
    {
      "id": 323,
      "start": 867.44,
      "end": 867.72,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    },
    {
      "id": 324,
      "start": 868.4,
      "end": 876.043,
      "en": "Bye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
  ],
